# Unity Play path

Ward's **Google Play / Android ship client** is `WardUnity/` (URP, IL2CPP, ARM64, ASTC). The Capacitor/Three.js tree remains the design reference until Unity parity.

- Prefer native Unity builds (`WardUnity/Tools/ship-android.ps1` or `build-android.ps1` / `build-aab.ps1`) over Capacitor WebView APKs for Play.
- Keep `applicationId` `com.vaelus.arpg`, target API 36, min 24, versionCode/versionName coherent with Play.
- Drive APK/AAB pointer: `G:\My Drive\Ward\releases\apk\ward-debug.apk` / `ward-release.aab` (overwrite current; no archive hoarding).
- Do not commit `Library/`, `Temp/`, `Builds/`, `*.apk`, `*.aab`, or upload keystores under `UserSettings/`.
